+| V2-R8 | Model | Development alert origins March–September 2025, outcomes through December 2025; reserve alert origins March–May 2026, outcomes through August 2026. Eligible reserved event onsets are April–July 2026. No tuning on reserve; label this temporal known-company backtest, not independent unseen-group validation. |
+| V2-R9 | Model | Match alerts chronologically by company/sign to earliest unmatched eligible event 1–2 calendar months later, one-to-one. Candidate and baseline share the event denominator. Require full `o-1..o+3` robust observation before an unmatched alert is false; otherwise censored unknown. Report left/right censoring, gaps, opportunities and unmatched observed events. |
