+## Preregistered handoffs and gates
+
+These are the original gate requirements, not permission to repeat consumed phases. T5 consumes only the existing `assessment/companies.json` and sibling manifest, verifies their pinned SHA256 identities and nested schema, and shares the dictionary locally. `as_of` API/MCP reads enforce closed-month bounds and full-case visibility; cash and v1 proxy reject alternate historical dates. No service/browser computes new event labels. Overall acceptance remains with the coordinating owner.
