+3. **Data → Model:** pinned panel and assignment, company/group/month, eligible known EUR inputs, bounds and declared month-end availability. Preserve exclusions and missing reasons; no inferred cash stock or future labels as features.
+4. **Model → App:** versioned monthly rows with `as_of`, state, direction, interval evidence, recent/prior arithmetic, coverage and missing reasons; distinct watch/confirmation dates; nullable separate v1 probability and horizon. T5 implements this as the distinct `operating_trajectory` kind with safe manifest resolution and historical filtering; the cash/proxy contracts remain separate.
